 **Parameters:**
-*   **Isovalue ($\tau$):** The scalar threshold for the isosurface. Changing this requires rebuilding the Iso-surface BVH [S1].
-*   **Clipping Planes:** Defined by $t_{min}$ and $t_{max}$ on the ray [S1].
